---
---
<section class="gap">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="eyebrow">The gap</div>
		<h2>Most growing businesses do not have a marketing problem. They have a leadership gap.</h2>
		<p>
			Marketing tasks are getting done. Ads are running. Vendors are busy. But no one owns the
			strategy. Messaging changes by channel. Budgets get spent without clear return. Decisions feel
			reactive. Growth feels harder than it should.
		</p>
		<p>
			Owners end up managing marketing instead of leading the business. That is expensive. In money.
			In time. In stress.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="solution">
	<div class="solution-grid">
		<div class="photo-placeholder">Photo: entrepreneur in office</div>
		<div>
			<div class="eyebrow">Solution</div>
			<h2 class="solution-h2">This is where a Fractional CMO steps in.</h2>
			<p>
				SumoLab's founder acts as the owner of your marketing function, bringing clarity, direction,
				and accountability across strategy, execution, systems, and performance, so marketing
				supports growth instead of draining it.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.gap {
		padding: 90px 48px;
		background: var(--color-bg);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.wrap {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		color: var(--color-accent);
		font-size: var(--fs-eyebrow);
		letter-spacing: var(--ls-eyebrow);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: var(--fw-semibold);
	}
	.gap h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: var(--fs-heading-lg);
		line-height: var(--lh-heading);
		margin: 16px 0 20px;
	}
	.gap p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--fs-body);
		line-height: var(--lh-body);
		color: var(--color-ink-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.gap p + p {
		margin-top: 16px;
	}
	.solution {
		padding: 0 48px 90px;
		background: var(--color-bg);
	}
	.solution-grid {
		max-width: 980px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 48px;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.photo-placeholder {
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		background: var(--color-surface-sunken);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--color-ink-faint);
	}
	.solution-h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: var(--fs-heading-md);
		line-height: var(--lh-heading);
		margin: 16px 0;
	}
	.solution p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: var(--fs-body);
		line-height: var(--lh-body);
		color: var(--color-ink-muted);
		margin: 0;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.solution-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
